{"sectionId":"stoich/moles","items":[{"id":"stoich--moles-k001","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"물질량 n=m/M이고 입자 수 N=nNₐ이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k002","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"화학반응식의 계수는 몰비를 뜻하며 반응식에서 원자와 전하가 보존되어야 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k003","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"실험식은 원소의 가장 단순한 정수비, 분자식은 실제 원자 수이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k004","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"연소분석에서는 CO₂로부터 C, H₂O로부터 H의 양을 구하고 필요 시 질량차로 O를 추정한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k005","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"한계반응물은 각 반응물의 몰수를 반응 계수로 나눈 값이 가장 작은 물질이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k006","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"이론 수득량은 한계반응물로 계산하며 수득률=실제수득량/이론수득량×100%이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k007","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"몰농도 M=n/V(L), 몰랄농도 b=n/m_solvent(kg), 몰분율 xᵢ=nᵢ/Σn, 질량분율 wᵢ=mᵢ/Σm이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k008","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"희석에서 용질의 양이 보존되면 M₁V₁=M₂V₂이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k009","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"밀도와 질량분율이 주어진 용액의 몰농도는 1 L 기준 질량과 용질 몰수를 계산한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k010","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"유효숫자는 측정 정밀도와 계산 규칙에 맞춘다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k011","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"한계반응물은 단순 질량이나 몰수가 가장 작은 물질이 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k012","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"몰랄농도는 용매 질량 기준이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k013","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"수득률이 100%를 초과하면 수분·불순물·측정오류 등을 의심한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k014","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"희석식은 화학반응이 없는 같은 용질에 적용한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"stoich--moles-k015","sectionId":"stoich/moles","unitId":"stoich","subject":"chemistry","text":"H₂가 한계반응물로 H₂O 3 mol이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}